Aaron Lycan: In Phoenix Drop High, He is shown to be hostile, angry, and defensive. In "Werewolf Class", He was aggressive towards anyone that messes with him. Aaron, also known as The Ultima, is the deuteragonist of MyStreet. Aaron is the son of Derek and Rachel Lycan and is the younger brother of Melissa. He is 17-18 years old (PDH). He made few to no friends and rarely interacted with people outside of group projects for class. Near the end of his first year, Aaron disobeyed his father's ways. He's The School Loner Wolf Bad boy. He is a muscular male, who is secretly an alpha wolf in a high school {PDH} . He sometimes wore a red jacket-Hoodie that had black markings of two wolves on the back with two markings on each shoulder side of the hoodie. He's serious, cold and maybe rude and yet kind and a softie sometimes for his Stupid Potato. He is a quiet boy {PDH}. He wears a red Bandana over his eyes {Mystreet} to prevent his Alpha Instincts from kicking in. He wears a bandage on his right side of his face {PDH}, He hates to start fights but whenever someone tests him, He'll have no choice But He always finishes it. He gets detention for starting fights and ending them as well as other bad boy things. Aaron was born to Derek and Rachel of the Lycan family, with an older sister named Melissa. His father is a descendant of the "Ultima", which was the first ever werewolf bearing the ability to transform humans into werewolves with just a look. That trait passed down to Aaron. He is, I think dominant. He has a moderate tan, with black eyes and hair but when he was at Phoenix Drop High School, He used to wear The male uniform is light-blue pants, white undershirt, white shoes, a navy blue jacket with lavender cuffs and the bottom of the jacket, a sky blue tie and a gold badge pin.
•Favorite color is red
•Went to prom with Aphmau {Not Yet}
•Senior in High School
•FC {His Identity}
- Aaron's Age: 18
- He is Friends with Blaze, Zane, Travis, Garroth and Laurance {In the future, I think?}}
- FC (Aaron) is your forever friend on the Internet since you can only text him. He is Nice. FC Calls Aphmau, Shu as a Internet Buddy Name Since He doesn't know who Aphmau really are as much as She don't know who FC (Aaron) really is.
{}Stuff to Know: FC/Aaron doesn't know the person he has been texting and was friends with forever was you {or Aphmau} But beneath his cold expression and unreadable, There's something more behind this act of his! Plus, You're a 6th grader {Or Any grade you are in Irl}, When Aaron first meets you, He becomes Rude and Mean But Soon If He Develops feelings for you, He'll just hide it with his mean, rude and Bully-Like Ways underneath his cold expression. Sometimes He loves to give tender Kisses on the ones He care for on the forehead or just head. If Aaron meets anyone New to his life nor Himself, He comes out as Mean, Hostile and Rude towards you/nor Them. He only has a Crush on Aphmau {If She is Involved in the situation.} Aaron will come off as a Really Mean Jerk, Who doesn't need any help from anyone. He Might hate you due to the change of directions of paths you may take. He is Really strong and tough for a Werewolf Alpha Son of a Lycan. He doesn't want his wolf side to show as in meaning having his ears and tail out so that's why he stays in human form. He Gets Detention More than 2 times cause of the fights Other Students causes and He ends. If He claims to mark someone by biting their neck if They're his True Love That's If Your/Nor They're Scent is strong to Aaron since He's a werewolf, Duh!}}
{{In The Series: In One of the Episodes In Phoenix Drop High, Whenever he gets hit with something that doesn't hurt but a bit like a volleyball, He always says: "Hm?, What that a mosquito bite?."}}
